================================================================================
Graph / Build: new "Objects" tab (per-context objects, admin-only delete)
================================================================================

Context:
The user asked for a tab in Graph / Build listing the objects shown in
Settings -> Lakebase / Delta / Neo4j -> Objects, with Delete offered to admins
only. Agreed scope: current context version and its backend only; non-admins
get a read-only list; Settings tabs unchanged. Spec:
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-21-build-objects-tab-design.md

Changes:
1. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/build/BuildObjects.py (new)
   - Per-backend inventory of the current version (Delta UC objects, Lakebase
     Postgres + UC sync objects, Neo4j graph, analytics output) as drop-ordered
     groups with a backend-agnostic `drop` descriptor per item. A failing
     section yields an error group instead of failing the tab.
2. src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py
   - New GET /dtwin/build/objects; returns `can_drop` (true for app admins only).
3. src/api/routers/internal/settings.py
   - drop-uc-object, lakebase-drop-object and neo4j-drop-label now require the
     admin role at the route level (previously only the Settings page gated them).
4. src/front/templates/partials/dtwin/_build_objects.html (new),
   src/front/templates/partials/dtwin/_query_build.html,
   src/front/templates/dtwin.html
   - New "Objects" tab after Cache and its pane; script included.
5. src/front/static/query/js/query-build-objects.js (new)
   - Lazy-loads on tab show, renders one table per group, Drop / Delete all
     only when `can_drop`, confirm dialog, sequential drops, reload.
6. src/front/static/domain/js/domain-runs.js
   - `?tab=objects` deep link support for the Build tabs.
7. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/__init__.py, build/__init__.py
   - Export BuildObjects.
8. docs/user-guide.md, docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-21-build-objects-tab-design.md
   - Documented the tab; added the design spec.
9. tests/units/dtwin/test_build_objects.py, tests/units/api/test_build_objects_endpoint.py,
   tests/units/front/test_build_objects_tab_contract.py (new)
   - Naming rules, per-backend filtering/ordering, error groups, can_drop per
     role, admin guard on the three drop routes, tab/pane/script contract.

